---
import ProgramLayout from '@/layouts/ProgramLayout.astro';
---

<ProgramLayout
  title="Chiropractic Marketing Training Program | ChiroCandy Marketing, LLC"
  description="ChiroCandy's training program equips chiropractic teams to run Facebook ads, patient follow-up, SEO, and content systems in-house using proven proprietary frameworks."
  slug="training-program"
  heroTitle="Chiropractic Marketing Training Program"
  heroAnswer="The ChiroCandy Training Program teaches practice owners and clinic staff how to build, run, and scale patient acquisition systems internally using our battle-tested marketing playbooks."
  faqs={[
    {
      question: 'Does my staff need prior marketing experience?',
      answer:
        'No. Our training is built specifically for chiropractic team members with zero technical or media buying background. We provide exact step-by-step SOPs and screen recordings for every action.',
    },
    {
      question: 'How much time does the Training Program take each week?',
      answer:
        'Plan for an internal team member (marketing coordinator, front desk CA, or office manager) to dedicate 4 to 8 hours per week to practice growth: campaigns, follow-up, and content.',
    },
    {
      question: 'Can we transition to Done-For-You later if our team gets too busy?',
      answer:
        'Yes. Many practices start with Training and later upgrade to Done-For-You as patient volume grows and internal staff bandwidth shifts to patient care and clinic administration.',
    },
    {
      question: 'How is Training different from Done-For-You?',
      answer:
        'Training coaches your in-house staff to run ads, follow-up, SEO, and content using ChiroCandy playbooks. Done-For-You is the full-service engagement where ChiroCandy executes those systems for you.',
    },
  ]}
>
  <h2>What will your practice team learn?</h2>
  <p class="answer-first">
    The ChiroCandy Training Program transfers the exact frameworks, ad strategies, and follow-up automations responsible for driving over $450M in patient revenue into your internal clinic operations.
  </p>
  <p>
    Instead of outsourcing your marketing permanently, your team learns how to construct high-converting Meta and Google ad campaigns, produce educational authority videos, configure rapid lead follow-up workflows, and maintain dominant local SEO and AI search visibility.
  </p>

  <h2>Core curriculum modules</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>Offer Design &amp; Copywriting:</strong> Crafting ethical, compliant chiropractic offers that attract ideal cash and insurance patients without devaluing your clinical expertise.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Meta &amp; Google Ads Architecture:</strong> Step-by-step campaign setup, local demographic targeting, budget pacing, and conversion pixel configuration on Facebook, Instagram, and Google Search.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Video Authority Framework:</strong> How to script, record, and publish high-retention short-form educational videos that position your doctor as the preeminent health authority in your community.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Automated Lead Conversion &amp; Scheduling:</strong> Building automated text and email nurture sequences that convert inbound online inquiries into confirmed Day 1 appointments.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Proprietary ChiroCandy Frameworks:</strong> Full operational mastery of the <a href="/frameworks/known-found-trusted/">Known/Found/Trusted</a> model, <a href="/frameworks/perfect-patient-tribe-turbine/">Perfect Patient Tribe Turbine</a>, and <a href="/frameworks/3d-x-framework/">3D-X Framework</a>.
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Who should choose Training over Done-For-You?</h2>
  <p class="answer-first">
    The Training Program is designed for practices that have an enthusiastic internal team member (marketing coordinator, front desk CA, or office manager) ready to dedicate 4 to 8 hours per week to practice growth.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you want to develop proprietary marketing assets inside your practice, reduce long-term marketing overhead, and maintain complete hands-on control over your creative and messaging, training delivers the highest long-term return on investment. If your team is currently at maximum clinical capacity with zero administrative bandwidth, our <a href="/done-for-you-program/">Done-For-You program</a> is the recommended alternative.
  </p>
  <p>
    Both programs sit on the same <a href="/get-new-patients/">Get New Patients</a> acquisition system.
    See <a href="/case-studies/">case studies</a> for how the work looks in practice.
  </p>

  <h2>How training is delivered</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>On-Demand Video Modules &amp; Playbooks:</strong> Detailed SOPs, campaign templates, and video walk-throughs accessible 24/7.</li>
    <li><strong>Live Coaching &amp; Q&amp;A Sessions:</strong> Regular strategy checkpoints with ChiroCandy media buyers to review active campaigns and troubleshoot performance.</li>
    <li><strong>Campaign Creative &amp; Funnel Reviews:</strong> Direct expert feedback on your ads, copy, and landing pages before you spend ad budget.</li>
    <li><strong>Swipe Files &amp; Plug-and-Play Assets:</strong> Proven ad scripts, email templates, SMS follow-up sequences, and graphic templates ready to deploy.</li>
  </ul>
</ProgramLayout>
